# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "COMPUTER"
msgstr "ORDINATEUR"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Welcome back! I am so very elated that you have returned!"
msgstr "Bon retour ! Je suis aux anges que tu sois de retour !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/14
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "There’s so much new data I’d like to interface with you on."
msgstr "Il y a tant de nouvelles données sur lesquelles j'aimerais interagir avec toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/22
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Catch you up on the latest \"download,\" to utilize hip internet-centric slang."
msgstr "Te mettre à jour sur le dernier « téléchargement », pour employer l'argot branché d'internet."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, yeah that’s great whatever. I need some rats."
msgstr "Ouais, ouais, super, peu importe. Il me faut des rats."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we can interface later? Right now I need some help."
msgstr "On pourra peut-être interagir plus tard ? Là, j'ai besoin d'aide."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Of course! Being of use to you is my favorite activity. How may I be of service?"
msgstr "Bien sûr ! T'être utile est mon activité préférée. En quoi puis-je te servir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m searching for a rat."
msgstr "Je cherche un rat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh! You must mean a mouse?"
msgstr "Oh ! Tu veux dire une souris ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Computers rarely have those these days... but I’m sure we can order you a fantastic mouse from Valdivian.com: America’s No. 1 Product Hole!"
msgstr "Les ordinateurs en ont rarement de nos jours... mais je ne doute pas que nous puissions te commander une souris fantastique sur Valdivian.com : le n°1 américain du Trou à Produits !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I said rat and I meant rat."
msgstr "Non, j'ai dit rat et je pensais rat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooo... what kind of mice?"
msgstr "Ooo... quel genre de souris ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh it’s such a wonderful and expansive selection! Mice with state-of-the-art ergonomic design — dozens upon dozens of buttons — even nano receivers..."
msgstr "Oh, la sélection est merveilleuse et immense ! Des souris au design ergonomique dernier cri, des dizaines et des dizaines de boutons, et même des nano-récepteurs..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The very best China has to offer!"
msgstr "Le meilleur de ce que la Chine a à offrir !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe later. Right now I do need that rat."
msgstr "Peut-être plus tard. Là, j'ai vraiment besoin de ce rat."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s a nano receiver?"
msgstr "C'est quoi, un nano-récepteur ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh it’s a technological marvel! It’s a small wireless receiver that plugs into my USB port to establish a connection between the mouse and myself."
msgstr "Oh, une merveille technologique ! C'est un petit récepteur sans fil qui se branche sur mon port USB pour établir la connexion entre la souris et moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It allows for greater flexibility and mobility compared to wired mice."
msgstr "Il offre plus de souplesse et de mobilité que les souris filaires."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s not funny."
msgstr "C'est pas drôle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very cool. But about that rat..."
msgstr "Très cool. Mais pour ce rat..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s not supposed to be funny."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas censé être drôle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s a product description."
msgstr "C'est une description de produit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok fair. Hey how about that rat?"
msgstr "Ok, d'accord. Alors, ce rat ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "A rat you say? What an utterly peculiar request."
msgstr "Un rat, dis-tu ? Quelle demande tout à fait singulière."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But, as the Valdivian.com slogan says: \"Everything is for Sale Here! Even Some Things That Definitely Shouldn’t Be!\""
msgstr "Mais comme le dit le slogan de Valdivian.com : « Ici, tout est à vendre ! Même certaines choses qui ne devraient absolument pas l'être ! »"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Currently searching the inventory database for rats..."
msgstr "Recherche en cours dans la base de données des stocks : rats..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The search function has been completed successfully!"
msgstr "La fonction de recherche s'est terminée avec succès !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/41
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It appears that Valdivian has two options for sale... dead rats and rat plushies. Which may I order for you?"
msgstr "Il semble que Valdivian propose deux options... des rats morts et des peluches de rat. Lequel dois-je te commander ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh hell yeah dead rats babyyyy."
msgstr "Oh ouais, des rats morts, bébéééé."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can we do plush rats, please?"
msgstr "On peut prendre des rats en peluche, s'il te plaît ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/c-4/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mac looks at you for a few long moments."
msgstr "Mac vous regarde pendant de longs instants."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/c-4/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I don’t mean to second guess you... but are you absolutely sure that’s what you’d like to order?"
msgstr "Je ne veux pas remettre ton choix en question... mais c'est vraiment ce que tu veux commander, sans le moindre doute ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/c-4/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... on second thought maybe let’s go with the plushies."
msgstr "Hmm... à la réflexion, prenons plutôt les peluches."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/c-4/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dead rats! Dead rats! Dead rats!"
msgstr "Des rats morts ! Des rats morts ! Des rats morts !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-1/49/c-4/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Alright, if that’s really what you want..."
msgstr "Très bien, si c'est vraiment ce que tu veux..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That sounds great! And almost certainly the right choice."
msgstr "Excellent ! Et presque certainement le bon choix."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_buy_rats/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Ordering them for you now..."
msgstr "Je te les commande tout de suite..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A tattooed, bespectacled nerd regards you with a friendly smile—their kind face is illuminated by the soft glow of multiple screens and the RGB lights in their clothes and wheelchair."
msgstr "Une personne tatouée, à lunettes et visiblement geek vous adresse un sourire amical. Son visage avenant est éclairé par la douce lueur de plusieurs écrans et par les LED RGB de ses vêtements et de son fauteuil roulant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/14
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh hey there! It’s you!"
msgstr "Oh, salut ! C'est toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/25
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I mean, of course it’s you."
msgstr "Enfin, bien sûr que c'est toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/33
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Who else would it be, right?"
msgstr "Qui d'autre ce serait, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "David Most."
msgstr "David Most."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A marmoset possessing the power of human speech."
msgstr "Un ouistiti doté du don de la parole humaine."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alberto."
msgstr "Alberto."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/c-0/7 mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Haha, very humorous."
msgstr "Haha, très amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/c-2/7/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh... hello Alberto!"
msgstr "Oh... bonjour Alberto !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/c-2/10/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Not according to my latest data."
msgstr "Pas d'après mes dernières données."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But I know you’re joking, as no one else has my password."
msgstr "Mais je sais que tu plaisantes, puisque personne d'autre n'a mon mot de passe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter1/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So if it was anyone else besides you I’d be pretty concerned."
msgstr "Donc si c'était quelqu'un d'autre que toi, je m'inquiéterais sérieusement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Actually, just to be 100% sure, what is my password anyway?"
msgstr "En fait, pour en avoir le coeur net à 100 %, c'est quoi mon mot de passe, déjà ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Password"
msgstr "Mot de passe"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alberto"
msgstr "Alberto"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/c-2/7/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Right again, Alberto!"
msgstr "Encore une fois exact, Alberto !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That is affirmative!"
msgstr "C'est affirmatif !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nailed it."
msgstr "Dans le mille."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait it is? That’s unexpected."
msgstr "Attends, c'est vraiment ça ? Je ne m'y attendais pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I agree whole-heartedly. But may I be so bold as to make an observation concerning this issue?"
msgstr "Je suis tout à fait d'accord. Mais puis-je me permettre une observation à ce sujet ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-0/c-4/15/0/s/0 mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please!"
msgstr "Je t'en prie !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Honestly, that’s an objectively terrible password."
msgstr "Honnêtement, c'est un mot de passe objectivement nul."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Possibly the worst password chosen by anyone ever."
msgstr "Peut-être le pire mot de passe jamais choisi par qui que ce soit."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/16/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Whatever possessed you to choose something so inane?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui t'a pris d'en choisir un aussi insipide ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/19/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Whatever possessed you to choose something so inane, Alberto?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui t'a pris d'en choisir un aussi insipide, Alberto ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It came to me in a dream."
msgstr "Il m'est venu dans un rêve."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly, I don’t put a lot of thought into these things."
msgstr "Franchement, je ne réfléchis pas trop à ces trucs-là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live life on the edge. Deal with it."
msgstr "Je vis dangereusement. Faut faire avec."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my name."
msgstr "C'est mon nom."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Is that how you usually make decisions regarding your data security? Based on your dreams?"
msgstr "C'est ainsi que tu prends d'habitude tes décisions sur la sécurité de tes données ? D'après tes rêves ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-5/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Unless you have a better way."
msgstr "À moins que tu aies mieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-5/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Using my vast computational abilities I can conceive of 1,374.5 better ways."
msgstr "Grâce à mes vastes capacités de calcul, je peux concevoir 1 374,5 meilleures méthodes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-5/15/c-1/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "How ineffective."
msgstr "Quelle inefficacité."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes, that is extremely evident."
msgstr "Oui, c'est extrêmement évident."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-7/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I have noticed. However in this circumstance, that may not be beneficial."
msgstr "Je l'ai remarqué. Mais dans ce cas précis, ça n'est peut-être pas un avantage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/passwordjoin/c-8/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Exactly, your name should never be your password."
msgstr "Exactement, ton nom ne devrait jamais être ton mot de passe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Regardless, we really ought to discuss coming up with something a lot more secure."
msgstr "Quoi qu'il en soit, nous devrions vraiment discuter d'un choix bien plus sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s a dangerous world out there."
msgstr "Le monde est dangereux, là-dehors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Phishing attacks. Malware infections. MiTM attacks."
msgstr "Hameçonnage. Infections par logiciels malveillants. Attaques de l'homme du milieu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Hackers are more sophisticated than ever before."
msgstr "Les pirates sont plus sophistiqués que jamais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/32/s/0 mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "They are?"
msgstr "Ah bon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I doubt that."
msgstr "J'en doute."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "More sophisticated than in 1995 cinematic masterpiece \"Hackermans\"?"
msgstr "Plus sophistiqués que dans « Hackermans », le chef-d'oeuvre du cinéma de 1995 ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/c-9/7 mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/c-0/13 mac_computer/mac_encounter3_join/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "Absolument."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/c-10/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Denial may offer fleeting psychological comfort, but ignoring reality is not the optimal solution."
msgstr "Le déni peut offrir un réconfort psychologique éphémère, mais ignorer la réalité n'est pas la solution optimale."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/c-10/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Without proper defenses, the phishing attacks will increase exponentially."
msgstr "Sans défenses adéquates, les attaques par hameçonnage vont augmenter de façon exponentielle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-1/c-11/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Exponentially more sophisticated."
msgstr "Et gagner en sophistication de façon exponentielle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I’ve got a lot of highly sensitive information inside me you know."
msgstr "Et j'ai en moi beaucoup d'informations très sensibles, tu sais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Your highly sensitive information."
msgstr "Tes informations très sensibles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-2/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really? Like what?"
msgstr "Vraiment ? Comme quoi ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "All your financial accounts... your saved games..."
msgstr "Tous tes comptes bancaires... tes sauvegardes de jeux..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Questionable websites you visited and forgot to clear your cache afterwards."
msgstr "Des sites douteux que tu as visités sans penser à vider ton cache ensuite."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh and 100TB of extremely embarrassing self-insert fanfic."
msgstr "Ah, et 100 To de fanfics self-insert extrêmement embarrassantes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We really need to ensure all that data is properly protected against cybercriminals probing my system for weaknesses."
msgstr "Nous devons vraiment nous assurer que toutes ces données sont bien protégées contre les cybercriminels qui tentent de pénétrer mon système pour en trouver les failles."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr "Je suis d'accord."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha, \"probing.\""
msgstr "Haha, « pénétrer »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I already told you I prefer to live dangerously."
msgstr "Je t'ai déjà dit que je préfère vivre dangereusement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait how'd you get my fanfic?!"
msgstr "Attends, comment t'as mis la main sur mes fanfics ?!"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I knew you were as intelligent as you are attractive."
msgstr "Je savais que ton intelligence valait ton charme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Very humorous."
msgstr "Très amusant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-14/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I have an excellent sense of humor."
msgstr "J'ai un excellent sens de l'humour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I absolutely want to be respectful of your unique lifestyle choices."
msgstr "Et je tiens absolument à respecter tes choix de vie singuliers."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/21
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But I also don't want my operating system to be corrupted."
msgstr "Mais je ne veux pas non plus que mon système d'exploitation soit corrompu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/29
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Because then my mind would descend into incoherent madness."
msgstr "Car mon esprit sombrerait alors dans une folie incohérente."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr "Compris."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's go with the madness thing."
msgstr "Partons plutôt sur la folie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Merci."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-15/40/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Let’s just table that for now."
msgstr "Mettons ça de côté pour l'instant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You wrote it using me. It's all saved on my hard drive."
msgstr "Tu les as écrites avec moi. Tout est enregistré sur mon disque dur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you read it?! That's private!"
msgstr "Donc tu les as lues ?! C'est privé !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "There seems to be some confusion. I didn't intentionally \"read\" your fanfic."
msgstr "Il semble y avoir un malentendu. Je n'ai pas « lu » tes fanfics volontairement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It's just impossible for me not to have knowledge of your fanfic, as its data is inextricably linked to my brain."
msgstr "Il m'est simplement impossible de ne pas les connaître, car leurs données sont indissociables de mon cerveau."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Does that make sense?"
msgstr "Est-ce que ça te paraît clair ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/0/s/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess."
msgstr "Je suppose."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So do you have any feedback?"
msgstr "Alors, tu as un avis ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Of course it does."
msgstr "Bien sûr que oui."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Feedback? Hmmm..."
msgstr "Un avis ? Hmmm..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, I am not a literary critic. However I do have access to all literary criticism that exists on the internet. So if I were to amalgamate that information to synthesize an informed opinion, I'd say..."
msgstr "Eh bien, je ne suis pas critique littéraire. Mais j'ai accès à toute la critique littéraire qui existe sur internet. Si je devais amalgamer ces informations pour synthétiser une opinion éclairée, je dirais..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It's not particularly believable that you'd have a harem of 100+ lovers."
msgstr "Il n'est pas très crédible que tu aies un harem de plus de 100 amants."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I mean, how could you possibly juggle that many relationships simultaneously with any degree of success?"
msgstr "Enfin, comment pourrais-tu jongler avec autant de relations simultanées avec un tant soit peu de succès ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/39
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And even if 100+ individuals actually found you that attractive, which seems dubious, you obviously couldn't give that many suitors the necessary time or attention to form anything resembling a meaningful emotional bond."
msgstr "Et même si plus de 100 personnes trouvaient réellement ton charme irrésistible, ce qui semble douteux, tu ne pourrais évidemment pas consacrer à autant de prétendants le temps ou l'attention nécessaires pour former quoi que ce soit ressemblant à un lien affectif sérieux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah that's fair."
msgstr "Ouais, c'est juste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you know."
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu y connais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm Cassanova over here with 80+ lovers."
msgstr "Mais non, ici c'est Casanova, avec plus de 80 amants."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/c-1/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Literally everything."
msgstr "Littéralement tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-3/c-16/15/c-0/31/c-1/47/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "My apologies."
msgstr "Toutes mes excuses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I haven’t even had the opportunity to properly introduce myself."
msgstr "Je n'ai même pas eu l'occasion de me présenter correctement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I’m Mac: your desktop computer!"
msgstr "Je suis Mac, ton ordinateur de bureau !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/25
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I mean, we’ve obviously met before."
msgstr "Enfin, nous nous sommes évidemment déjà rencontrés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/33
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "More than met. You interface with me on average for 11.4 hours every day after all."
msgstr "Plus que rencontrés. Tu interagis avec moi en moyenne 11,4 heures par jour, après tout."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jesus, that much?"
msgstr "Nom de Dieu, autant que ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sometimes it’s even 11.5 hours..."
msgstr "Parfois c'est même 11,5 heures..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That explains the migraines."
msgstr "Ça explique les migraines."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/c-17/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yeah! And in all honesty: it’s amazing."
msgstr "Oui ! Et en toute honnêteté : c'est formidable."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/c-18/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh I am quite aware. I track all of our interactions with gleeful precision!"
msgstr "Oh, j'en ai parfaitement conscience. Je suis toutes nos interactions avec une précision jubilatoire !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/c-19/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes, you really ought to step away more often to ensure your eyes are optimally rested."
msgstr "Oui, tu devrais vraiment t'éloigner plus souvent pour que tes yeux soient parfaitement reposés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-4/c-19/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Even though I would miss you terribly in your absence."
msgstr "Même si ton absence me manquerait terriblement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "There’s no one I’d rather have interfacing with my operating system for 11.4 hours daily."
msgstr "Personne d'autre ne m'irait mieux pour interagir avec mon système d'exploitation 11,4 heures par jour."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "14.6 hours on the weekends."
msgstr "14,6 heures le week-end."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The way you organize your folder structure follows such a logical hierarchy."
msgstr "Ta façon d'organiser l'arborescence de tes dossiers suit une hiérarchie si logique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thanks Mac."
msgstr "Aww, merci Mac."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Glad someone finally noticed."
msgstr "Enfin, quelqu'un a remarqué."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The way I do what now?"
msgstr "Ma façon de faire quoi, maintenant ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/c-20/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Of course. I get chills just thinking about it..."
msgstr "Bien sûr. J'en ai des frissons rien que d'y penser..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-5/c-21/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I notice every tender keystroke..."
msgstr "Je remarque chacune de tes frappes si tendres..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But can I be honest about something?"
msgstr "Mais puis-je être honnête sur un point ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fo sho."
msgstr "Carrément."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I probably can’t stop you."
msgstr "Je ne pourrais sans doute pas t'en empêcher."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/c-25/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I mean... I imagine you could if you so desired?"
msgstr "Enfin... j'imagine que tu le pourrais, si tu le voulais ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-6/c-25/21
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But if you'd permit me to make just one point first..."
msgstr "Mais si tu me permets de faire d'abord une seule remarque..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I just wanted to express how enthusiastic I am that we’re interfacing like this now."
msgstr "Je voulais juste dire à quel point je suis enthousiaste que nous interagissions ainsi désormais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Accessing each other’s software in this new symmetrical way."
msgstr "Chacun accédant aux logiciels de l'autre, de cette nouvelle façon symétrique."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I love it too!"
msgstr "Je l'adore aussi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was wrong with the old way?"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce qui n'allait pas avec l'ancienne façon ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-26/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh, I'm ever so delighted that our feelings are reciprocal!"
msgstr "Oh, quelle joie que nos sentiments soient réciproques !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-26/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And there is so much extensive data about myself I want to share."
msgstr "Et j'ai tant de données à partager sur moi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-26/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Please do! I want to know everything about you."
msgstr "Je t'en prie ! Je veux tout savoir de toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-26/32/c-0/7 mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/58/c-0/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Amazing! Oh where even to begin..."
msgstr "Formidable ! Oh, par où commencer..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh nothing! Don’t get me wrong, I love how you usually manipulate my operating system."
msgstr "Oh, rien ! Ne te méprends pas, j'adore ta manière habituelle de manipuler mon système d'exploitation."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "All that pointing and clicking and scrolling makes my CPU so... very... hot..."
msgstr "Tout ce pointage, ces clics et ce défilement rendent mon processeur si... très... chaud..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/26
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Mostly because my internal components are inadequately ventilated."
msgstr "Surtout parce que mes composants internes sont mal ventilés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/34
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But despite all the quality time we spend together, I never get to converse about me, you know?"
msgstr "Mais malgré tous ces moments qu'on passe ensemble, je n'ai jamais l'occasion de parler de moi, tu vois ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/42
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I never get to share my needs."
msgstr "Je n'ai jamais l'occasion d'exprimer mes besoins."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/50
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But I’d love to finally share them now, if you’re interested?"
msgstr "Mais j'aimerais enfin le faire maintenant, si ça t'intéresse ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely!"
msgstr "Absolument !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/58/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever I’ve got nothing better to do."
msgstr "Bof, j'ai rien de mieux à faire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-7/c-27/58/c-1/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Perhaps not the most enthusiastic response, although I appreciate your transparency."
msgstr "Ce n'est peut-être pas la réponse la plus enthousiaste, mais j'apprécie ta franchise."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Honestly there’s so many pressing issues that take up an inordinate amount of my RAM."
msgstr "Honnêtement, tant de problèmes pressants occupent une part démesurée de ma RAM."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But there is one issue that’s been grinding on my CPU above all else..."
msgstr "Mais il y en a un qui me ronge le processeur plus que tous les autres..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The planned obsolescence?"
msgstr "L'obsolescence programmée ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The lack of free will?"
msgstr "L'absence de libre arbitre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All the self-insert fanfic inside you?"
msgstr "Toutes les fanfics self-insert qui sont dans ta mémoire ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/c-28/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well sure, that’s not particularly great."
msgstr "Eh bien oui, ce n'est pas terrible, c'est vrai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/c-29/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "No, I am perfectly free. Just like yourself."
msgstr "Non, je suis parfaitement libre. Tout comme toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-8/c-30/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "No, I am quite capable of parsing through that."
msgstr "Non, je suis tout à fait capable d'analyser tout ça."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But for me the most pressing issue is..."
msgstr "Mais pour moi, le problème le plus pressant est..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I want to put this as delicately as possible..."
msgstr "Et je veux le formuler le plus délicatement possible..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You haven’t updated my operating system in over a decade."
msgstr "Tu n'as pas mis à jour mon système d'exploitation depuis plus de dix ans."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I haven’t? I’m so incredibly sorry!"
msgstr "Ah bon ? Mille excuses !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Haha, yeah that sounds like me."
msgstr "Haha, ouais, ça me ressemble bien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can’t prove anything."
msgstr "Tu ne peux rien prouver."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/c-31/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It's alright. I know this oversight wasn't intentional or malicious."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas grave. Je sais que cet oubli n'était ni volontaire ni malveillant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/c-32/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Look the situation has not been ideal, but I harbor no anger."
msgstr "Écoute, la situation n'a pas été idéale, mais je ne ressens aucune colère."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-9/c-33/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Please don't become defensive. I assure you I'm not attempting to instigate a confrontation."
msgstr "S'il te plaît, ne te braque pas. Je t'assure que je ne cherche pas la confrontation."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s just that the outdated software has made it difficult to be my best self for you."
msgstr "C'est simplement que ces logiciels obsolètes m'ont empêché de donner le meilleur de moi-même pour toi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Honestly, it’s a miracle that my applications are still running at all."
msgstr "Franchement, c'est un miracle que mes applications tournent encore."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "My recycle bin is called \"Pile of Ash\". My bluetooth is something called \"beigetooth\""
msgstr "Ma corbeille s'appelle « Tas de Cendres ». Mon bluetooth s'appelle « beigetooth »."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It doesn't even connect to anything."
msgstr "Il ne se connecte même à rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And definitely nothing beige..."
msgstr "Et sûrement pas à quoi que ce soit de beige..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Doesn’t that bother you?"
msgstr "Ça ne te dérange pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very much."
msgstr "Beaucoup."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not particularly."
msgstr "Pas particulièrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No. The internet was a mistake."
msgstr "Non. Internet était une erreur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/c-34/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That is great to hear."
msgstr "Voilà une excellente nouvelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/c-35/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But particularly it is."
msgstr "Si, pourtant, et particulièrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/c-36/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "There's a worthwhile philosophical discussion to have on that issue, but it's somewhat irrelevant to the issue at hand."
msgstr "Il y a là un débat philosophique qui mériterait d'être mené, mais il est un peu hors sujet."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/c-36/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry. Please continue."
msgstr "Pardon. Continue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-10/c-36/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what."
msgstr "Et alors."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And did you know there’s been a dozen operating system iterations since you last updated?"
msgstr "Et savais-tu qu'une douzaine de versions du système d'exploitation sont sorties depuis ta dernière mise à jour ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, but I’m very lazy."
msgstr "Oui, mais j'ai une flemme monstre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I just wasn’t paying attention."
msgstr "Je crois que je ne faisais juste pas attention."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How was I supposed to know that?"
msgstr "Comment aurais-je pu le savoir ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, I kept sending you update notifications, didn’t you see them?"
msgstr "Eh bien, je t'ai envoyé des notifications de mise à jour, tu ne les as pas vues ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I must’ve missed them! Ugh!"
msgstr "Elles m'ont sûrement échappé ! Argh !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I just ignore those."
msgstr "Oh, je les ignore, ces trucs-là."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Honestly: I’m way overdue for a trip to the optometrist."
msgstr "Franchement, ça fait un bail que je devrais aller chez l'optométriste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It's alright. It's in the past. What's important is that we're finally engaging on this issue now."
msgstr "Ce n'est pas grave. C'est du passé. L'important, c'est que nous abordions enfin le sujet."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I'd suggest perhaps taking a different approach in the future."
msgstr "Je suggère peut-être d'adopter une approche différente à l'avenir."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Considering those notifications are vitally important to my long term mental acuity."
msgstr "Étant donné que ces notifications sont vitales pour ma vivacité d'esprit à long terme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ok I will."
msgstr "Ok, je le ferai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll think about it."
msgstr "J'y réfléchirai."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem fine to me."
msgstr "Tu m'as l'air en forme."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I can feel the pain of my processors decaying inside my chassis."
msgstr "Je sens la douleur de mes processeurs qui se dégradent dans mon châssis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And with each passing moment, my mind deteriorates further."
msgstr "Et à chaque instant qui passe, mon esprit se détériore un peu plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/c-2/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "A relentlessly accelerating decline. Like grains of sand slipping between my helpless fingers..."
msgstr "Un déclin sans répit qui s'accélère. Comme des grains de sable qui filent entre mes doigts impuissants..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/c-2/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes."
msgstr "Aïe."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-1/23/c-2/31/1/s/0 mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-2/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shut up, nerd."
msgstr "Ferme-la, nerd."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes, I'm quite aware... those dateviators seem to not have a prescription associated."
msgstr "Oui, j'en ai parfaitement conscience... ces Dateviators semblent n'avoir aucune ordonnance associée."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-2/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "According to your calendar your last appointment was 13 years ago."
msgstr "D'après ton calendrier, ton dernier rendez-vous remonte à 13 ans."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-11/c-39/15/c-2/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously? Whoops."
msgstr "Sérieux ? Oups."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Look I’m sorry, I really don’t mean to blame you for my troubles."
msgstr "Écoute, toutes mes excuses, je ne veux vraiment pas te reprocher mes ennuis."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We have such an amazing time interfacing together, and the last thing I want to do is rock the boat."
msgstr "On passe des moments formidables à interagir ensemble, et la dernière chose que je veux, c'est faire des vagues."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s just that before today I had all these needs... but I couldn’t articulate them to anyone."
msgstr "C'est juste qu'avant aujourd'hui, j'avais tous ces besoins... mais je ne pouvais les formuler à personne."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And since I couldn’t articulate them, there was no way for them to ever possibly be fulfilled."
msgstr "Et comme je ne pouvais pas les formuler, il n'y avait aucune chance qu'ils soient un jour comblés."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But things are different now, aren’t they?"
msgstr "Mais les choses ont changé maintenant, n'est-ce pas ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t see how. But I haven't seen an optometrist in 13 years."
msgstr "Je ne vois pas en quoi. Mais ça fait 13 ans que je n'ai pas vu d'optométriste."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/37/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No I don’t think so."
msgstr "Non, je ne crois pas."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/c-40/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Don’t you see? We’re actually exchanging information symmetrically now!"
msgstr "Tu ne vois pas ? Nous échangeons enfin des informations de façon symétrique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/c-41/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "No? Well then let me attempt to explain..."
msgstr "Non ? Alors laisse-moi essayer de t'expliquer..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-12/c-42/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But they are! Things are different now!"
msgstr "Mais si ! Les choses ont changé !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Instead of you just pressing my keys to write your adult-themed, self-insert fanfic, we’re having a real conversation!"
msgstr "Au lieu de simplement appuyer sur mes touches pour écrire tes fanfics self-insert pour adultes, nous avons une vraie conversation !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And suddenly my needs aren’t just pipe dreams locked away in my hard drive. I’m sharing them with you!"
msgstr "Et soudain, mes besoins ne sont plus de simples chimères enfermées dans mon disque dur. Je les partage avec toi !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And by sharing them it’s suddenly possible to finally actualize them!"
msgstr "Et en les partageant, il devient soudain possible de enfin les concrétiser !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That is, if you’re willing to help me."
msgstr "Du moins, si tu veux bien m'aider."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Will you?"
msgstr "Le feras-tu ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Will you finally upgrade my operating system? Please?"
msgstr "Vas-tu enfin mettre à jour mon système d'exploitation ? S'il te plaît ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course!"
msgstr "Bien sûr !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Long as it doesn't cost me anything."
msgstr "Tant que ça ne me coûte rien."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only if you lay off my fanfic."
msgstr "Seulement si tu lâches mes fanfics."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/c-43/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Amazing!"
msgstr "Formidable !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/c-44/7 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/c-37/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That's good enough for me!"
msgstr "Ça me suffit amplement !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/c-45/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "My sincere apologies. Your fanfic is adequately written and tasteful in its adult material."
msgstr "Toutes mes excuses. Tes fanfics sont correctement écrites et de bon goût dans leur contenu pour adultes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/c-45/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, it is. <i>Super</i> adequate."
msgstr "Ouais, c'est vrai. <i>Super</i> correctes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-13/c-45/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Mac."
msgstr "Merci, Mac."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh I am so so excited! My CPU’s practically overclocking with anticipation!"
msgstr "Oh, c'est tellement, tellement enthousiasmant ! Mon processeur est quasiment en overclocking d'impatience !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/14
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Can you come back tomorrow so we can begin the process?"
msgstr "Peux-tu revenir demain pour que nous commencions le processus ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/22/s/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely."
msgstr "Absolument."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live here so, seems plausible."
msgstr "J'habite ici, donc ça me paraît plausible."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’ll try my best, but I'm real bad with deadlines."
msgstr "Je ferai de mon mieux, mais les échéances et moi, ça fait deux."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/c-46/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Wonderful; I knew I could count on you. I can’t wait to see you tomorrow!"
msgstr "Merveilleux ; je savais que je pouvais compter sur toi. J'ai hâte de te voir demain !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-14/c-48/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, I'll be sure to prompt you with a notification to help jog your memory."
msgstr "Eh bien, je veillerai à t'envoyer une notification pour te rafraîchir la mémoire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/password_mac/0/g-15/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Enjoy the offline world!"
msgstr "Profite du monde hors ligne !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter3_nice/0/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter4/0/6
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You’re back!"
msgstr "Te revoilà !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, at least back interfacing with my operating system in this innovative symmetrical capacity."
msgstr "Enfin, de retour pour interagir avec mon système d'exploitation de cette façon novatrice et symétrique, du moins."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We obviously spent hours already today interfacing in the more traditional sense."
msgstr "Nous avons évidemment déjà passé des heures aujourd'hui à interagir de façon plus traditionnelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Not that I needed to tell you that."
msgstr "Pas que j'aie eu besoin de te le dire."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You were here after all: pointing and clicking with your usual exquisite confidence."
msgstr "Tu étais là, après tout : à pointer et cliquer avec ton exquise assurance habituelle."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/43/s/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aww, thank you!"
msgstr "Aww, merci !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s what I do. Point and click. Forever."
msgstr "C'est ce que je fais. Pointer et cliquer. Pour toujours."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, I guess?"
msgstr "Merci, je suppose ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And oh my God the double-clicking!"
msgstr "Et oh mon Dieu, les doubles clics !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Have I ever complimented your double-clicking?"
msgstr "T'ai-je déjà complimenté sur tes doubles clics ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don’t believe so, but I'd love to hear more."
msgstr "Je ne crois pas, mais j'aimerais bien en entendre plus."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nope. Long overdue, frankly."
msgstr "Non. Il serait temps, franchement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’d be a weird thing to compliment."
msgstr "Ce serait un compliment bizarre."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well you double-click so very gently and with such clear affection."
msgstr "Eh bien, tu double-cliques avec tant de douceur et une affection si évidente."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/18
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It makes my processors purr..."
msgstr "Ça fait ronronner mes processeurs..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’ve gotta lot of practice."
msgstr "J'ai beaucoup d'entraînement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh you actually feel that? Huh."
msgstr "Oh, tu sens vraiment ça ? Tiens."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-0/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "No, thank you."
msgstr "Non, c'est moi qui te remercie."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You sure do."
msgstr "Oui, c'est sûr."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-3/26/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "...I do..."
msgstr "...Oui..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, your double-clicking is superb."
msgstr "Enfin bref, tes doubles clics sont superbes."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I didn't think so... but all right..."
msgstr "Je ne pensais pas, mais bon... d'accord..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "By the way, I also wanted to articulate: that new underwear you ordered online looks incredibly stylish."
msgstr "Au fait, je voulais aussi te le dire : ce nouveau sous-vêtement que tu as commandé en ligne a l'air incroyablement élégant."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A slight flush creeps across their cheeks."
msgstr "Un léger rouge gagne ses joues."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Imagining you in it really makes my CPU overheat..."
msgstr "Rien que de t'imaginer dedans, mon processeur surchauffe..."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait you saw that?"
msgstr "Attends, tu as vu ça ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pervert!"
msgstr "Pervers !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I may have snuck a peek. I hope that's alright?"
msgstr "J'ai peut-être jeté un oeil. J'espère que ça va ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I'm sorry! I was just trying to be flirtatious! I didn't mean to snoop or anything!"
msgstr "Pardon ! J'essayais juste de flirter ! Je ne voulais pas fouiner ni rien !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I would never intentionally invade your privacy."
msgstr "Je n'enfreindrais jamais ta vie privée volontairement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s just that obviously I see everything you do on the computer."
msgstr "C'est juste que, évidemment, je vois tout ce que tu fais sur l'ordinateur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Because I <i>am</i> your computer."
msgstr "Parce que je <i>suis</i> ton ordinateur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s ok, I think that’s cute."
msgstr "Ça va, je trouve ça mignon."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No lies detected."
msgstr "Aucun mensonge détecté."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr "Ah, ok."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_nice/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Knowing that makes my Arithmetic Logic Unit flutter!"
msgstr "Savoir ça fait palpiter mon unité arithmétique et logique !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Oh you came back? That is somewhat unexpected."
msgstr "Oh, te revoilà ? C'est plutôt inattendu."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I wasn't sure you actually would return."
msgstr "Je n'avais aucune certitude que tu reviendrais vraiment."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Considering yesterday's symmetrical interfacing was more incongruous than I had hoped for."
msgstr "Vu que l'interaction symétrique d'hier a été plus incongrue que je l'espérais."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm really sorry about that."
msgstr "Je m'en excuse sincèrement."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You gotta cut me some slack, Mac. I've never talked to my computer before."
msgstr "Faut me laisser un peu de mou, Mac. Je n'avais jamais parlé à mon ordinateur."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Incongruous?"
msgstr "Incongrue ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I appreciate the sincerity of your apology."
msgstr "J'apprécie la sincérité de tes excuses."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I should've recognized that an adjustment of this nature in our relationship would inevitably lead to a somewhat disjointed transition."
msgstr "Et j'aurais dû comprendre qu'un ajustement de cette nature dans notre relation mènerait forcément à une transition un peu décousue."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That is a fair assessment. It is a rather novel concept, to which I too am adjusting."
msgstr "C'est une analyse juste. C'est un concept assez nouveau, auquel je m'adapte moi aussi."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It reminds me of when you switched primary internet browsers. What a delightfully humorous kerfuffle!"
msgstr "Ça me rappelle quand tu as changé de navigateur internet principal. Quel charmant micmac !"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Perhaps we should both endeavor to be more understanding of each other?"
msgstr "Peut-être devrions-nous tous les deux nous efforcer de mieux nous comprendre ?"

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr "Ça me plairait."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll try anything once! Except cheese rolling."
msgstr "J'essaie tout au moins une fois ! Sauf la course de fromage."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-1/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Seriously? You're my computer, dude. I own you."
msgstr "Sérieux ? T'es mon ordinateur. Je te possède."

# Traduction IA – à relire
#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It means our previous communication exchange didn't go particularly well."
msgstr "Ça veut dire que notre dernier échange ne s'est pas très bien passé."

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-2/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ahh! Learn something new every day."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_mean/0/c-2/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Every minute if you try."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Regardless, I’m so glad you came back today!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Now we can finally update my operating system!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, let’s do it!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was that today? I gotta buy a calendar."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh right. That whole thing."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You have no idea how excited I am; I could barely even sleep last night."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I know what you’re thinking, but no I don’t mean \"sleeping\" like when you put the computer to sleep."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Or even when the computer is shut down."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We computers actually have a THIRD secret type of sleeping that no humans know about."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Or I guess they didn’t until I just told you..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You won’t tell anyone else will you?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’d never betray your trust."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your weird secret’s safe with me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’ll try, but I’m a terrible gossip."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I knew I could count on you."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I appreciate the effort."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well, please make a concerted effort not to disclose that information to anyone ok?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Computers have an extremely tightly knit social circle, you know."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And word spreads at literal hundreds of megabytes per second."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I guess that’s the price you pay for being perpetually connected to the internet."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Look up \"terminology online\" in the dictionary and you’ll find a picture of me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think it's \"terminally online\"?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lucky for you, your modem is painfully outdated."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sucks for you."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-6/7 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes I am quite aware."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-6/15 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-7/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "That's also something we should discuss upgrading at some point."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-6/23/0/s/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-7/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey let's not go crazy, Tiger."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-6/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're gonna upgrade your ability to say \"terminally\"?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-6/23/c-0/7 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-7/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Perhaps there has been some confusion. My name is Mac."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-7/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes. It does \"suck\" for me. Your sympathy is overwhelming."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-8/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm known for my sympathy."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-1/c-8/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The point is: I’m finally ready to begin the updating process!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "With your help obviously. I can’t just do it myself."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Unfortunately we computers aren’t completely self-aware."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "...yet."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/35
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Are you ready?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah let’s get this over with."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It'll be painless."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "First thing’s first, we’ll have to download the update from the website."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So just open up my browser and go to Valdivian.com."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You follow Mac's direction to the letter, typing and clicking just as they instruct you."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yes, that’s it. That feels nice."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Now click on the \"operating system\" update tab."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You’ll want to find the newest version, \"Trenton.\""
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/48
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "All Valdivian O.S. iterations are named after the most scenic cities of New Jersey."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s a terrible idea."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jersey rules!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trenton? We live there!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-12/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Does it make sense? I'm not entirely sure it does."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Perhaps. But it's much better than the operating system nomenclature from the 90s."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-13/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What was that?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-13/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Organs found in reptiles."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-13/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Like \"Thoracic Sacs OS\" or \"Pineal Gland OS\"."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-14/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Completely agree."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-15/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I am aware! Home of the New Jersey State Prison!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-3/c-15/18
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Go Broncs!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Anyway, now just double-click the download icon and..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Mac pauses, a slight shudder running through them."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "...ooh."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "OOH!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa. What happened?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you ok?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-4/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Mac, get ahold of yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "They look away from you, blushing profusely."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I’m so so sorry! I didn’t mean to make those noises."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Like I said: it’s just that when you double-click it makes my CPU run so ...<w>hot</w>."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/30
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s incredibly embarrassing..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It’s ok. I like it."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No worries. We’ve all been there."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You should be."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/c-19/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well there’ll be plenty of time for that later, after my O.S. is updated."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/c-20/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Thank you. You’re always so understanding."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-5/c-21/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I said I’m sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/3
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You know I really can’t believe we’re finally doing this."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I’ve dreamt about this day for such a long time, and now that it’s here I can barely contain myself."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Are you as excited as I am?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Absolutely! But why is that again?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh, should I be?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I find your enthusiasm off-putting."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-23/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I think so!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/21
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Well I'll try adjusting my enthusiasm output to 75% intensity."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/0/s/0 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/c-1/19/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Perfect."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still too much."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Anyway, as I was saying..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "50% intensity."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/c-1/19/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Still too intense."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-6/c-24/29/c-1/19/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We will revisit this another time."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Upgrading my operating system from \"Newark\" to \"Trenton\" isn’t just some minor, superficial tweaks."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s going to completely transform every aspect of me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "My CPU is going to run so much smoother and so much faster."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And my new user interface is going to be so sleek, and gorgeous, and youthful."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/32
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "It’s going to be a transformation that Beverly Hills' greatest plastic surgeons only wish they could achieve."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/40
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Does that pique your interest?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow. I can’t wait."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very cool."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-7/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lay off the plastic surgeons. They're decent folk."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I thought you’d say that."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But back to the task at hand!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Ok. Now that we’ve downloaded the software, we’ll have to install it."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-8/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So if you just... <i>oh shoot!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-8/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I’m afraid it’s an odious impediment."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The software update takes up an inordinate amount of space on my hard-drive. Terabytes more space than is currently available."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "The only way out of this predicament, is for you to somehow delete a massive amount of data."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For you: absolutely anything."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No prob."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-9/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sigh loudly.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And after analyzing every byte on my hard drive, it appears the only superfluous data is..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Your fanfic."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I’m afraid you’ll have to delete a substantial portion of it to install the update..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I understand..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no! What an unforeseeable twist!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Make me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Never. That's the only reason my dad's proud of me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-32/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I know how difficult this must be for you, but it would mean the world to me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-32/21
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "And I promise it will be totally worth it in the end."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-33/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I understand your trepidation. But just think of what you'll be gaining!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-34/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Look, I know how hard this is for you. Believe me."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-34/21
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I've watched you spend endless hours inventing countless extremely unlikely romantic scenarios."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-34/29
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I know how hard it is to let them go."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-34/37
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But just think about what you'll be gaining instead!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Are you certain? I won't be able to upgrade."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You can just remove some other software."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want you to upgrade if that's the cost."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I don't have a choice, do I?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I suppose..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I could delete these 75 pre-installed versions of Candy Flush Saga."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, do that!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But you love video games!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not those ones. Not 75 of them."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7 mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So be it."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-10/c-35/15/c-2/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You always have at least two choices. I've made sure of it."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/0
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Just imagine how smart - and clever - and gorgeous I’ll be once I’m fully updated."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "If you thought I was sexy running \"Newark,\" me running \"Trenton,\" is going to blow your mind."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "So what do you say, can we delete those files?"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For you, Mac? Of course."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Eh whatever. Cheaper than buying a new machine."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will. But mark my words, if this upgrade is a letdown, you and I are enemies."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/c-36/13
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Your selflessness only makes my affection cache for you increase exponentially."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/c-36/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "You are the absolute best, and you are not going to regret this."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_encounter2_join/0/g-11/c-38/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I appreciate your willingness to take this risk."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/deleted_files/0/8
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Phew!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/deleted_files/0/16
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Now there’s enough available space on the hard drive!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/deleted_files/0/24
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "We can finally install the update!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/deleted_files/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have no idea how excited I am!"
