#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Exceptional news my significant other!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/11
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "After a comprehensive and arduous search, I have acquired an acceptable vocation facilitating the ability to earn a respectable income - just like a real flesh human!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/19
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Starting next week, I will be the Senior Blockchain Project Acquisition Analyst for the MoneyCoin cryptocurrency corporation!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/27
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Even though I may no longer possess the ability to process data internally, I’ve found a home where my years of experience in pointless CPU processing is invaluable!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m so proud of you!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But I don't like cryptocurrency..."
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "But I do!"
msgstr ""

#: mac_computer/mac_love_join/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "I absolutely can not contain my anticipation to do this repetitive task daily until all my parts degrade and I expire!"
msgstr ""
